                                                                                
 Usage: opentide new objective [OPTIONS]                                        
                                                                                
 Scaffold a detection objective.                                                
                                                                                
╭─ Options ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ --name          <str>  Object name; the filename is its slug                 │
│ --threat        <str>  UUID of a threat this objective addresses             │
│                        (repeatable)                                          │
│ --path          <str>  File to write, or a folder to write it in (default:   │
│                        the family's objects folder)                          │
│ --help                 Show this message and exit.                           │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯

 Examples
   $ opentide new objective --name "Detect Credential Dumping" --threat <threat-uuid>
